# Agent Wallet Bench

Coding agents set up crypto wallets on their own. Each square is one agent with one wallet; its link opens every run.

<%= line(@matrix.notes["setup"]) %>

<%= line(@matrix.notes["runs"]) %>

<%= line(@matrix.notes["grid_started"]) %>

## What each result means

<%= for outcome <- outcomes() do %>- `<%= outcome %>`: <%= line(@matrix.notes[outcome]) %>
<% end %>
<%= for grid <- @matrix.grids do %>
## <%= grid_title(grid.grid) %>

<%= grid.tested %> of <%= grid.total %> squares have results; <%= grid.never_run %> never run.

The checks, in order:
<%= for {criterion, n} <- Enum.with_index(grid.criteria, 1) do %>
<%= n %>. <%= line(criterion.criterion) %><% end %>

<%= grid_table(@matrix, grid) %>
<% end %>
Results come from Techtree as each run finishes.
<%= trailer() %>
